{"unit_id":"SJTUMalPan__dsh-subpages#feature-1","repo":"SJTUMalPan/dsh-subpages","commit":"37b8325b98f93f80169b7b518e3312ae47d34a0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subpages 的功能「看板门户入口」：插件在 DSH 侧边栏底部放置「看板」链接，点击后在新标签页打开门户；门户用导航栏和 iframe 展示已挂载页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:32-56","web/shell.html:11-27"]}
